    {
      "page_title": "Six Signals To Leave Context & Picking A Store",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Tearing"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "External stores need useSyncExternalStore to avoid tearing",
            "Context is tear-free by construction"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "takeaway",
          "title": "The Honest Row",
          "text": "Context wins on zero-dependency ambient values. Stores win on frequent updates, selective reads, and tooling."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Signals 1-3",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Re-renders driven by fields a component never reads",
            "Splitting contexts has stopped helping",
            "Many updates per second with many consumers",
            "Cursor position, live collaboration, animation state",
            "You must read or write state outside the React tree"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "Outside-The-Tree Cases",
          "items": [
            "A raw event listener",
            "A websocket handler",
            "An imperative library callback"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Signals 4-6"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Server data: TanStack Query or SWR, not Context and not Redux",
            "You've hand-written undo/redo, persistence, or an action log",
            "The provider pyramid passed ~6 levels",
            "Composition helpers are papering over an architecture problem"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Picking One"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Tool",
            "Fits"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Zustand",
              "small hook-shaped store, selectors"
            ],
            [
              "Jotai / Recoil",
              "atomic, bottom-up derived state"
            ],
            [
              "Redux Toolkit",
              "big teams, conventions, devtools"
            ],
            [
              "XState",
              "the logic is a real state machine"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "The Middle Option"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Keep Context, but put an immutable store object in it",
            "Subscribe per consumer with useSyncExternalStore",
            "Selectors without adding a dependency"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "js",
          "lines": [
            "useSyncExternalStore(",
            "  subscribe,",
            "  getSnapshot,",
            "  getServerSnapshot // required for SSR",
            ");"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Skip the third argument and hydration will mismatch"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_title": "When Not To Migrate & The Decision Ladder",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Counter-Signals"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Do NOT migrate theme, locale, auth user, or feature flags",
            "Anything changing a few times per session stays in Context",
            "'The app is getting bigger' alone is not a reason"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "The Bar",
          "text": "Migrate only for a measured re-render cost, or a capability Context cannot provide."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Migration Path"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Contexts and stores coexist — this is not an either/or",
            "Move one high-churn domain at a time",
            "Leave the ambient values in Context"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "The Decision Ladder",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "kind": "flow",
          "spec": {
            "nodes": [
              "useState",
              "lift state up",
              "composition / children",
              "Context",
              "+ useReducer",
              "split contexts",
              "external store"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Take a rung only when the one below it demonstrably fails",
            "Skipping rungs is how apps acquire Redux for a theme toggle"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "State vs Reducer"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
