    {
      "page_title": "Summary: Checklist, Trade-offs & Final Rule",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "takeaway",
          "title": "Say It Once More",
          "text": "Context is distribution, not storage. Remember that and half the confusion disappears."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Optimisations By Leverage"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "1. Stable value identity via useMemo",
            "2. Stable children on the provider",
            "3. Split contexts by change rate"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Provider Checklist"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Is the value memoized?",
            "Are the functions inside it stable?",
            "Does the provider take children?",
            "Is the value split by change rate?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Never Assume — Profile"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "DevTools 'why did this render' names the triggering context",
            "Server state ≠ client state",
            "Cache-shaped data belongs in a query library regardless"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Strengths & Limits"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Strengths",
            "Limits"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Zero bundle cost",
